      de: ["Established in 1976 to monitor the impact of a massive hydroelectric dam.", "Crucial sanctuary for the critically endangered snow leopard population.", "Located in the extremely rugged Sayan Mountains of southern Siberia.", "Provides an ideal high-altitude habitat for the Siberian ibex.", "Protects over 1,000 distinct species of vascular mountain flora.", "Strict anti-poaching patrols actively safeguard the local wildlife.", "Features dramatic elevation changes ranging from 500 to nearly 3,000 meters."],
