      en: ["Kunashir Island", "Volcanic flora", "Kuril harbor seals", "Only island reserve"],
      es: ["Isla Kunashir", "Flora volcánica", "Focas de las Kuriles", "Única reserva insular"],
      pt: ["Ilha Kunashir", "Flora vulcânica", "Focas-das-kurilas", "Única reserva insular"],
      fr: ["Île Kounachir", "Flore volcanique", "Phoques des Kouriles", "Seule réserve insulaire"],
